# With no structure in x the field is a half cosine between the walls and the index follows from the exact slab index.
# Reference: analytic slab index 1.641680, lowered by the lateral half cosine to 1.638820; agreement limited by the grid.
title 400 nm nitride film, TM, between distant walls
grid dx=0.1 dy=0.01
window width=8 ymin=-1.2 ymax=1.6
layer sin 0 0.4
symmetry even
field tm
expect neff 1.638750262 2e-8
expect confinement 0.420781197 1e-6
expect guided no
expect cells 11200
expect neff 1.638820 3e-3
